{"seq":3,"slug":"build-automation","title":"构建自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals/build-automation","wordCount":1112,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"构建自动化\">构建自动化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>构建自动化是将源代码转化为可部署制品的全自动化过程。在现代前端和全栈项目中，&quot;构建&quot;远不只是编译——它涵盖了依赖安装、代码转译、打包优化、静态分析、类型检查、资产处理等一系列步骤。构建的目标是产出<strong>确定性</strong>的制品：相同的输入永远产出相同的输出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[源代码] --&gt; B[依赖安装]&#10;    B --&gt; C[类型检查]&#10;    C --&gt; D[代码转译]&#10;    D --&gt; E[打包优化]&#10;    E --&gt; F[资产处理]&#10;    F --&gt; G[制品产出]&#10;    G --&gt; H[完整性校验]&#10;    subgraph 确定性构建&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;        F&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[源代码] --&gt; B[依赖安装]\n    B --&gt; C[类型检查]\n    C --&gt; D[代码转译]\n    D --&gt; E[打包优化]\n    E --&gt; F[资产处理]\n    F --&gt; G[制品产出]\n    G --&gt; H[完整性校验]\n    subgraph 确定性构建\n        B\n        C\n        D\n        E\n        F\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构建策略</th>\n<th>全量构建</th>\n<th>增量构建</th>\n<th>远程缓存构建</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原理</td>\n<td>每次从零开始</td>\n<td>只处理变更文件</td>\n<td>复用远程制品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次速度</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>等于全量</td>\n<td>等于全量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后续速度</td>\n<td>等于首次</td>\n<td>快 30-70%</td>\n<td>快 80-95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>Release 构建</td>\n<td>本地开发</td>\n<td>团队 CI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"依赖安装优化\">依赖安装优化</h2><p>依赖安装通常占构建总时间的 30-50%。在 CI 环境中，每次构建都在全新容器中启动，没有本地缓存，这使得依赖安装成为最大的性能瓶颈。</p>\n<p><strong>Lockfile 冻结安装</strong>是 CI 中必须使用的策略。<code>pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</code> 确保安装的包版本与 lockfile 完全一致，任何不匹配都会导致安装失败而不是静默更新。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DependencyStrategy {&#10;  packageManager: &#39;pnpm&#39; | &#39;npm&#39; | &#39;yarn&#39;;&#10;  installCommand: string;&#10;  cacheKey: string;&#10;  cachePaths: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const pnpmStrategy: DependencyStrategy = {&#10;  packageManager: &#39;pnpm&#39;,&#10;  installCommand: &#39;pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#39;,&#10;  cacheKey: &#39;pnpm-${{ hashFiles(&quot;pnpm-lock.yaml&quot;) }}&#39;,&#10;  cachePaths: [&#39;~/.local/share/pnpm/store&#39;],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DependencyStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  packageManager</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pnpm'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'npm'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'yarn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  installCommand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cacheKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cachePaths</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pnpmStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DependencyStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  packageManager: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  installCommand: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm install --frozen-lockfile'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cacheKey: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm-${{ hashFiles(\"pnpm-lock.yaml\") }}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cachePaths: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'~/.local/share/pnpm/store'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>pnpm 的内容寻址存储（Content-Addressable Storage）天然适合 CI 缓存。它的 store 目录按包内容的哈希值组织，不同项目共享相同的包只存储一次：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Setup pnpm store cache&#10;  uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;  with:&#10;    path: ~/.local/share/pnpm/store&#10;    key: pnpm-store-${{ runner.os }}-${{ hashFiles(&#39;pnpm-lock.yaml&#39;) }}&#10;    restore-keys: |&#10;      pnpm-store-${{ runner.os }}-&#10;&#10;- name: Install dependencies&#10;  run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Setup pnpm store cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/cache@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">~/.local/share/pnpm/store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm-store-${{ runner.os }}-${{ hashFiles('pnpm-lock.yaml') }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restore-keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      pnpm-store-${{ runner.os }}-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Install dependencies</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于 Monorepo，还可以利用 <strong>部分安装</strong>：只安装受影响包的依赖。Turborepo 的 <code>--filter</code> 参数配合 <code>pnpm install --filter</code> 可以实现这一点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-构建编排\">Monorepo 构建编排</h2><p>Monorepo 中多个包之间存在依赖关系，构建顺序必须遵循拓扑排序。Turborepo 和 Nx 通过分析 <code>package.json</code> 中的依赖图自动确定构建顺序和并行度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[core] --&gt; B[markdown]&#10;    A --&gt; C[storage]&#10;    A --&gt; D[logger]&#10;    B --&gt; E[doc-hub app]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; F[doc-reader app]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    subgraph 并行层 1&#10;        A&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 并行层 2&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 并行层 3&#10;        E&#10;        F&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[core] --&gt; B[markdown]\n    A --&gt; C[storage]\n    A --&gt; D[logger]\n    B --&gt; E[doc-hub app]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; F[doc-reader app]\n    C --&gt; F\n    subgraph 并行层 1\n        A\n    end\n    subgraph 并行层 2\n        B\n        C\n        D\n    end\n    subgraph 并行层 3\n        E\n        F\n    end</pre><p>Turborepo 的远程缓存是 Monorepo 构建的关键加速器。它将每个任务的输入（源文件哈希 + 环境变量 + 依赖版本）映射到输出制品，当输入未变时直接复用缓存的输出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;tsconfig.json&quot;, &quot;package.json&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;tests/**&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;coverage/**&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;tsconfig.json&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsconfig.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"package.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tests/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coverage/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsconfig.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>远程缓存的命中率直接决定了 CI 构建时间。一个成熟的 Monorepo 项目，远程缓存命中率通常在 70-90%，这意味着大部分包的构建结果可以直接从缓存中获取，CI 时间从 15 分钟缩短到 2-3 分钟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"docker-构建优化\">Docker 构建优化</h2><p>容器化部署的项目需要在 CI 中构建 Docker 镜像。Docker 构建的优化核心是<strong>层缓存</strong>——Docker 按 Dockerfile 中的指令顺序构建层，只要某层的输入没变，就复用缓存层。</p>\n<p>关键技巧是<strong>依赖安装层与代码层分离</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"FROM node:20-alpine AS base&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;&#10;FROM base AS deps&#10;COPY pnpm-lock.yaml package.json ./&#10;RUN corepack enable &amp;&amp; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile --prod&#10;&#10;FROM base AS build&#10;COPY pnpm-lock.yaml package.json ./&#10;RUN corepack enable &amp;&amp; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;COPY . .&#10;RUN pnpm build&#10;&#10;FROM base AS runtime&#10;COPY --from=deps /app/node_modules ./node_modules&#10;COPY --from=build /app/dist ./dist&#10;ENV NODE_ENV=production&#10;CMD [&quot;node&quot;, &quot;dist/server.js&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine AS base</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM base AS deps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY pnpm-lock.yaml package.json ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN corepack enable &#x26;&#x26; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile --prod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM base AS build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY pnpm-lock.yaml package.json ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN corepack enable &#x26;&#x26; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY . .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN pnpm build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM base AS runtime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=deps /app/node_modules ./node_modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=build /app/dist ./dist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ENV NODE_ENV=production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CMD [\"node\", \"dist/server.js\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个多阶段构建将依赖安装（变化少）和代码编译（变化多）分离，确保依赖层被频繁复用。最终的运行时镜像只包含生产依赖和编译产物，镜像体积最小化。</p>\n<p>在 CI 中进一步加速 Docker 构建：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Build and push&#10;  uses: docker/build-push-action@v5&#10;  with:&#10;    context: .&#10;    push: true&#10;    tags: registry.io/app:${{ github.sha }}&#10;    cache-from: type=gha&#10;    cache-to: type=gha,mode=max&#10;    platforms: linux/amd64,linux/arm64\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build and push</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker/build-push-action@v5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">registry.io/app:${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cache-from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">type=gha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cache-to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">type=gha,mode=max</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    platforms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">linux/amd64,linux/arm64</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>GitHub Actions Cache</strong> 作为 Docker BuildKit 的缓存后端，可以跨构建复用所有层缓存。<code>mode=max</code> 确保所有中间层都被缓存，而不仅仅是最终层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"构建可观测性\">构建可观测性</h2><p>构建过程需要可观测性——你需要知道构建为什么慢、哪个步骤是瓶颈、缓存命中率如何。没有可观测性，构建优化就是盲目的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BuildTrace {&#10;  buildId: string;&#10;  startedAt: Date;&#10;  finishedAt: Date;&#10;  stages: StageTrace[];&#10;  cacheStats: CacheStats;&#10;  environment: Record&lt;string, string&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface StageTrace {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  duration: number;&#10;  cacheHit: boolean;&#10;  exitCode: number;&#10;  logs: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CacheStats {&#10;  totalTasks: number;&#10;  cacheHits: number;&#10;  cacheMisses: number;&#10;  hitRate: number;&#10;  savedTime: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BuildTrace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  buildId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  startedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  finishedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  stages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StageTrace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cacheStats</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CacheStats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  environment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StageTrace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  duration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cacheHit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  exitCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  logs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CacheStats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalTasks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cacheHits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cacheMisses</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hitRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  savedTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Turborepo 的 <code>--summarize</code> 参数会生成构建摘要 JSON，包含每个任务的执行时间、缓存状态和依赖链。将这些数据发送到监控系统，可以构建构建性能的趋势图：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>P50/P95 构建时间</strong>：构建时间的分布，发现异常值</li>\n<li><strong>缓存命中率趋势</strong>：命中率下降通常意味着有人修改了缓存键相关的文件</li>\n<li><strong>阶段耗时分布</strong>：哪个阶段占比最高，优化投入应聚焦在那里</li>\n<li><strong>失败率与失败原因</strong>：区分 flaky 失败和真实失败</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>构建自动化的核心目标是确定性——相同输入必须产出相同输出</li>\n<li>依赖安装优化首选 lockfile 冻结 + 包管理器缓存，可缩减 30-50% 构建时间</li>\n<li>Monorepo 构建依赖拓扑排序和远程缓存，成熟项目缓存命中率达 70-90%</li>\n<li>Docker 多阶段构建分离依赖层和代码层，配合 BuildKit 缓存后端跨构建复用</li>\n<li>构建可观测性（耗时分布、缓存命中率、失败率）是持续优化的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"构建自动化","id":"构建自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖安装优化","id":"依赖安装优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 构建编排","id":"monorepo-构建编排"},{"level":2,"text":"Docker 构建优化","id":"docker-构建优化"},{"level":2,"text":"构建可观测性","id":"构建可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流水线设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals/pipeline-design"},"next":{"title":"制品管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals/artifact-management"}}